128
00:08:28,875 --> 00:08:34,165
Granny Jess, Grandpa Michael,
Grandpa Matt, Granny Amy.

129
00:08:34,166 --> 00:08:35,874
They had my dad Jack.

130
00:08:35,875 --> 00:08:38,707
And they had my mom MJ.

131
00:08:38,708 --> 00:08:42,374
