163
00:09:50,958 --> 00:09:52,332
-They're both blurry.
-Okay.

164
00:09:52,333 --> 00:09:54,624
How about now?

165
00:09:54,625 --> 00:09:55,958
Neither one.

166
00:09:56,541 --> 00:09:57,707
Mrs. Mabachas.

167
00:09:57,708 --> 00:09:58,915
-Mm-hmm?
-You have my stapler

168
00:09:58,916 --> 00:10:01,958
