169
00:10:03,958 --> 00:10:05,999
Mrs. Mabachas.

170
00:10:07,375 --> 00:10:08,707
How was Norway?

171
00:10:08,708 --> 00:10:10,249
-What?
-You were telling me

172
00:10:10,250 --> 00:10:12,249
