1707
01:29:28,083 --> 01:29:29,249
Dinner.

1708
01:29:29,250 --> 01:29:30,332
Walk.

1709
01:29:33,166 --> 01:29:34,208
Go fetch.

1710
01:29:35,541 --> 01:29:36,874
Are you ready...

1711
01:29:36,875 --> 01:29:39,415
for the one, the only...

